  "tldr": "One page, eleven sections, shown live from `npm run dev`. Two picks: the hero headline and the closing band's title; each version shows in place. Every section names where its copy and layout live, mostly `src/content/site.ts` and one component.",
  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "brief",
      "title": "Brief",
      "lead": "The page sells bluedoc to developers who already use a coding agent, and ends at the install commands.",
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "text",
          "md": "All copy, links and screenshots live in `src/content/site.ts`, one export per section; the components in `src/components/` only lay it out. A comment on a section comes back with that section's source hints, so the agent edits the export first and the component only for layout."
        },
        {
          "type": "checklist",
          "id": "brief",
          "title": "Picks",
          "numbered": false,
          "items": [
            {
              "id": "hero-headline",
              "text": "Which hero headline?",
              "sub": "Recommend the current one: the page title, the social card and the README use it.",
              "recommend": "a",
              "choices": [
                {
                  "id": "a",
                  "label": "Decide on a page"
                },
                {
                  "id": "b",
                  "label": "Answer, not read"
                },
                {
                  "id": "c",
                  "label": "Point, pick, approve"
                }
              ],
              "detail": "**Decide on a page** is the current `hero.headline`. Changing it also means `meta.title`, `meta.ogImageAlt` and `public/og.png` (`npm run og`).",
              "choice": "a"
            },
            {
              "id": "cta-title",
              "text": "Which title for the closing band?",
              "sub": "Recommend the current one: it is short enough for one line at 390 px.",
              "recommend": "a",
              "choices": [
                {
                  "id": "a",
                  "label": "Decisions, not walls"
                },
                {
                  "id": "b",
                  "label": "Answer on a page"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
